{"schemaVersion":1,"id":22,"sections":[{"id":"111001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[710],"start":0,"count":10},{"id":"111001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[10700],"start":10,"count":5},{"id":"111002-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[720],"start":15,"count":4},{"id":"111002-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[10710],"start":19,"count":6},{"id":"111003-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[730],"start":25,"count":3},{"id":"111003-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[10720],"start":28,"count":10}],"frames":[{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111001-PROLOGUE:710:2","scriptId":710,"text":"“之前你们说在那里发现了大量战车兽的尸体？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111001-PROLOGUE:710:3","scriptId":710,"text":"“恩，从体态上来看，算是战车兽吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111001-PROLOGUE:710:4","scriptId":710,"text":"“算是？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":247,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111001-PROLOGUE:710:5","scriptId":710,"text":"“身上的战车装甲都被剔除了，而且最诡异的是连血液也都消失了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":247,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111001-PROLOGUE:710:6","scriptId":710,"text":"“不会是吸血鬼吧……连血都没有的尸体……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":40,"right":247,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":86,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111001-PROLOGUE:710:7","scriptId":710,"text":"“不会吧……吸血鬼真的存在？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":40,"right":86,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":247,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111001-PROLOGUE:710:8","scriptId":710,"text":"“不用担心啦，并没有发现类似吸血鬼那种咬痕，有个比较明显的动脉切口。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":247,"right":86,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111001-PROLOGUE:710:9","scriptId":710,"text":"“所以可以认为是人为的，就和杀鸡放血一样。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":247,"right":223,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111001-PROLOGUE:710:10","scriptId":710,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111001-PROLOGUE:710:11","scriptId":710,"text":"（有谁可以像杀鸡一样处理战车兽啊……？）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111001-EPILOGUE:10700:1","scriptId":10700,"text":"闲着无聊，仔细地端详了一下那块黏糊糊的‘线索’。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111001-EPILOGUE:10700:2","scriptId":10700,"text":"“这东西就和有生命一样，你戳它感觉还会收缩？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111001-EPILOGUE:10700:3","scriptId":10700,"text":"“呃，看了都觉得浑身不舒服，长官你还去戳它……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":84,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111001-EPILOGUE:10700:4","scriptId":10700,"text":"“反正我是不想再碰这玩意了……回去要换副新手套了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":84,"right":40,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111001-EPILOGUE:10700:5","scriptId":10700,"text":"“有那么脏么……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":84,"right":41,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111002-PROLOGUE:720:2","scriptId":720,"text":"“这算是完成了搜索任务吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111002-PROLOGUE:720:3","scriptId":720,"text":"“从结果上来说，虽然没有发现人形怪物，但是至少发现了点线索。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111002-PROLOGUE:720:4","scriptId":720,"text":"“我只是担心索菲亚教官说这点还不够……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111002-PROLOGUE:720:5","scriptId":720,"text":"“我们这还是找到点线索了，要知道大多数搜索任务都是无功而返的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111002-EPILOGUE:10710:1","scriptId":10710,"text":"“此行还以为能遇到人形怪物呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111002-EPILOGUE:10710:2","scriptId":10710,"text":"“让人安心的失望，我还真是担心你们会遇上那个怪物……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111002-EPILOGUE:10710:3","scriptId":10710,"text":"“呵呵，担心我们？这点担心是多余了啦，如果碰到危险我会让奈乐她们先撤退的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111002-EPILOGUE:10710:4","scriptId":10710,"text":"“不计损失的侦察可称不上明智。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111002-EPILOGUE:10710:5","scriptId":10710,"text":"“好啦，我的指挥官大人，不用担心有的没的，反正结果我们是没遇上那个怪物。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111002-EPILOGUE:10710:6","scriptId":10710,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":103,"right":223,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111003-PROLOGUE:730:2","scriptId":730,"text":"“快要到达学院了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":81,"right":223,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111003-PROLOGUE:730:3","scriptId":730,"text":"“哦，终于要到交任务的时候了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111003-PROLOGUE:730:4","scriptId":730,"text":"（基本没出力，光是做后勤了……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111003-EPILOGUE:10720:1","scriptId":10720,"text":"经过一番周折终于又回到了伏龙芝学院。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111003-EPILOGUE:10720:2","scriptId":10720,"text":"汇报工作是奈乐负责了，于是我早早地找地方睡觉去了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111003-EPILOGUE:10720:4","scriptId":10720,"text":"伏龙芝会议室----","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111003-EPILOGUE:10720:5","scriptId":10720,"text":"“以上就是这次侦察任务的大致情况，之后我会提交一份书面的汇总。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":219,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111003-EPILOGUE:10720:6","scriptId":10720,"text":"“很好，这次的侦察算是有了比较明确的线索，把这块不明物质先带到我的研究室去。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":103,"right":219,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111003-EPILOGUE:10720:7","scriptId":10720,"text":"“好的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":103,"right":219,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111003-EPILOGUE:10720:8","scriptId":10720,"text":"说罢，奈乐带着不明物质退出了会议室。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":103,"right":219,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111003-EPILOGUE:10720:9","scriptId":10720,"text":"“那我们也就先告辞了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":103,"right":223,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111003-EPILOGUE:10720:10","scriptId":10720,"text":"“等等，沙狐小队，还有点事情希望你们留一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":211,"right":223,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111003-EPILOGUE:10720:11","scriptId":10720,"text":"“诶？还有什么别的事情吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":211,"right":223,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["返回伏龙芝学院，搜索任务算是没什么收获。","一路上大家都在讨论搜索的事情。","路途上偶尔会遇到战车兽，但是在沙狐小队面前都是不堪一击的。"]}
